{"data":{"actorId":"01KSK3QAE64QAADZ4Z86DY4771","createdAt":"2026-09-04T06:46:56.448Z","eventType":"comment.status_changed","id":"72","payload":{"from":"open","reason":"Fixed on the PR branch (8e1814d1). CONFIRMED: GRAPHIFY_BRIDGE was absent from the implementation inventory entirely, yet GraphifyClient executes it via os.getenv(\"GRAPHIFY_BRIDGE\", _default_bridge_path()) — so an overridden bridge changes every graphify ingest and search with no digest recorded. Now inventoried with path, source and sha256 like the other arm implementations. Note the default is COMPUTED rather than a constant, so the shared _client_default helper calls the attribute when it is callable. Fail-without-fix: KeyError 'GRAPHIFY_BRIDGE'.","to":"resolved"},"reviewId":"01M1NHXVDK6C2VAHZ67FWSJ4A0","targetId":"01M1NHXVDVN0BNN1VA00JJD836","targetType":"review_comment","trailId":"01M1NC2KDB8G41TMVXFNRMSDX4"},"event":"comment.status_changed"}
