{"data":{"actorId":"01KSK3QAE64QAADZ4Z86DY4771","createdAt":"2026-09-04T05:54:59.768Z","eventType":"comment.status_changed","id":"17","payload":{"from":"open","reason":"Fixed on the PR branch (5ba5d03b). CONFIRMED: URL path segments were kept as 'provenance', but a path carries a webhook or path-based credential as readily as userinfo — 'https://host/hooks/\u003csecret\u003e' was recorded verbatim. _scrub_value now keeps only scheme + host + port; a non-empty path becomes '/\u003credacted\u003e', joining the query and fragment already dropped. A bare host is untouched so the launcher's real http://localhost:18888 still records exactly. Fail-without-fix: 5 failures including the synthetic key found in '--mem0-host https://mem0.local/hooks/sk-FAKETESTKEY-...'.","to":"resolved"},"reviewId":"01M1NF982WVKF7QK7RN5B9Y5DR","targetId":"01M1NF98324S4YTX2Z1DSFQG1X","targetType":"review_comment","trailId":"01M1NC2KDB8G41TMVXFNRMSDX4"},"event":"comment.status_changed"}
{"data":{"actorId":"01KSK3QAE64QAADZ4Z86DY4771","createdAt":"2026-09-04T05:55:01.140Z","eventType":"comment.status_changed","id":"18","payload":{"from":"open","reason":"Fixed on the PR branch (5ba5d03b). CONFIRMED, and it leaked to TWO sinks: the EG_* catch-all recorded values verbatim into the artifact, AND assert_fair_mode interpolates that same map into its exception text, so a credential-bearing knob reached the CI log in cleartext too. Now routed through the _SECRET_RE filter, so a secret-named knob is fingerprinted ('EG_API_KEY=sha256:8454da0ae4c6') rather than printed — the knob is still recorded as set, which is what FAIR_MODE actually needs. Fail-without-fix: the synthetic key found in \"{'EG_API_KEY': 'sk-FAKETESTKEY-...'}\". Note the agent's own assessment: both defects were introduced by its earlier redaction fix, and both were the same mistake — keeping a component judged 'safe' rather than dropping everything not proven safe. The revised code applies allowlist discipline to URL components and report values, not just to option names.","to":"resolved"},"reviewId":"01M1NF982WVKF7QK7RN5B9Y5DR","targetId":"01M1NF983943QTNRAMYC3N5BH6","targetType":"review_comment","trailId":"01M1NC2KDB8G41TMVXFNRMSDX4"},"event":"comment.status_changed"}
